sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin as Administrator
    participant UI as Web Portal
    participant API as ShelfLifeDiscountsController
    participant Service as ShelfLifeDiscountService
    participant Store as ShelfLifeDiscountStore
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. VIEW CURRENT DISCOUNT CONFIGURATION
    %% ==========================================

    Admin->>+UI: Open Shelf-Life Discount Configuration

    UI->>+API: Current()
    API->>+Service: GetCurrentAsync()

    Service->>+Store: FindCurrentAsync()

    Store->>+DB: SELECT current discount table and tiers
    DB-->>Store: Active table and discount tiers
    deactivate DB

    Store-->>Service: ShelfLifeDiscountTableView
    deactivate Store

    Service-->>API: ShelfLifeDiscountTableResult
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: Current discount configuration
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Admin: Display current discount rules
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. OPTIONAL VIEW CONFIGURATION HISTORY
    %% ==========================================

    opt Administrator reviews previous versions

        Admin->>+UI: View discount configuration history

        UI->>+API: History()
        API->>+Service: ListHistoryAsync()

        Service->>+Store: ListAsync()

        Store->>+DB: SELECT historical discount tables
        DB-->>Store: Previous versions and effective dates
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: Discount table history
        deactivate Store

        Service-->>API: ShelfLifeDiscountHistoryResult
        deactivate Service

        API-->>UI: Configuration history
        deactivate API

        UI-->>Admin: Display previous versions
        deactivate UI

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 3. CONFIGURE DISCOUNT RULES
    %% ==========================================

    Admin->>+UI: Configure discount tiers and effective date

    Note over Admin,UI: Select Global, Category or SKU scope

    loop For each discount tier
        Admin->>UI: Enter remaining-life range and discount percent
    end

    UI-->>Admin: Display discount table preview

    %% ==========================================
    %% 4. SUBMIT NEW CONFIGURATION
    %% ==========================================

    Admin->>UI: Publish discount configuration

    UI->>+API: Publish(request)
    API->>+Service: PublishAsync(data, actorId)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 5. VALIDATE DISCOUNT CONFIGURATION
    %% ==========================================

    Service->>+Service: Validate(data)

    Note right of Service: Validate scope and target references
    Note right of Service: Validate percentage ranges and discount values
    Note right of Service: Reject overlapping tiers within the same scope

    Service-->>Service: Validation result
    deactivate Service

    alt Invalid discount configuration

        Note right of Service: Return validation error without saving

    else Configuration is valid

        %% ==========================================
        %% 6. LOAD CURRENT TABLE FOR UPDATE
        %% ==========================================

        Service->>+Store: FindCurrentForUpdateAsync()

        Store->>+DB: SELECT current ShelfLifeDiscountTable
        DB-->>Store: Current table and version
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: Current discount table
        deactivate Store

        %% ==========================================
        %% 7. RESOLVE NEXT VERSION
        %% ==========================================

        Service->>+Store: MaxVersionAsync()

        Store->>+DB: SELECT MAX Version FROM ShelfLifeDiscountTable
        DB-->>Store: Latest version number
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: Current maximum version
        deactivate Store

        %% ==========================================
        %% 8. VALIDATE PUBLICATION CONFLICTS
        %% ==========================================

        alt Conflicting effective version or publication

            Note right of Service: Reject conflicting publication

        else New version can be published

            %% ==========================================
            %% 9. PREPARE NEW DISCOUNT TABLE
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+Store: AddTable(newDiscountTable)

            Store-->>Service: Table staged
            deactivate Store

            %% ==========================================
            %% 10. PREPARE DISCOUNT TIERS
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+Store: AddTiers(newDiscountTiers)

            Store-->>Service: Discount tiers staged
            deactivate Store

            %% ==========================================
            %% 11. RECORD AUDIT INFORMATION
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+Store: AddAuditLog(publicationAudit)

            Store-->>Service: Audit record staged
            deactivate Store

            %% ==========================================
            %% 12. PERSIST CONFIGURATION VERSION
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+Store: SaveChangesAsync()

            Store->>+DB: INSERT ShelfLifeDiscountTable and tiers
            Note right of DB: Save audit and update prior version as applicable

            DB-->>Store: New configuration version saved
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Save successful
            deactivate Store

            %% ==========================================
            %% 13. RETRIEVE PUBLISHED VERSION
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+Store: FindByVersionAsync(newVersion)

            Store->>+DB: SELECT published table and discount tiers
            DB-->>Store: Published configuration
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: ShelfLifeDiscountTableView
            deactivate Store

            Note right of Service: Build published configuration result

        end

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 14. RETURN PUBLICATION RESULT
    %% ==========================================

    Service-->>API: Published configuration or business error
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: Publication response
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Admin: Display published version or validation errors
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% BUSINESS CONSTRAINTS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Service,DB: Only authorized Administrators may publish rules

    Note over Service,DB: Published versions remain traceable

    Note over Service,DB: New rules do not reprice finalized quotations

    Note over Service,DB: Shelf-life discounts never override MLOR eligibility